<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi Qassim Cement nine-month pre-tax,net falls.</title>
<headline>Saudi Qassim Cement nine-month pre-tax,net falls.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia's Qassim Cement Company on Monday issued the following results for the nine months to September 30, 1996:</p>
<p>		  (million Saudi riyals unless stated)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	     97.6	vs   120.5</p>
<p> Net operating income     86.6	vs   105.9</p>
<p> Other income		 11.0	vs    14.6</p>
<p> Shareholders' fund	742.3	vs   746.1</p>
<p> Assets			873.5	vs   847.8</p>
<p>Full Name: Qassim Cement Company.</p>
<p>Note: The company, one of eight cement firms in Saudi Arabia, is traded on the Saudi stock market.</p>
</text>
